# The mobile workspace stays out of the web upload, except the platform-free
# folders shared with the web app (model catalog, resumable media transport,
# saver notice policy, post publish policy). Gitignore semantics cannot
# re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded, so the contents are
# excluded level by level and the path down to each folder is re-included.
# Without this the Vercel build fails with "Module not found".
ugc-mobile/*
!ugc-mobile/lib
ugc-mobile/lib/*
!ugc-mobile/lib/model-catalog
!ugc-mobile/lib/media-upload
!ugc-mobile/lib/saver-notice-policy
!ugc-mobile/lib/post-publish-policy
